:expect-pins 4
# Fresh-process temporal case TA-10.

# Once both predecessor-standing witnesses are supplied, continuity is supportive rather than a denial gate.
? person(TA_Unregistered).
# => TRUE

# The successor omission remains visible.
? err(TA_Unregistered, StandingOmission).
# => TRUE

# Withholding either predecessor-standing witness can still suppress this derived route; universal standing is not a T1 result.
? person(TA_Unwitnessed_Standing).
# => FALSE

# Without the second witness, T1 cannot name an omission; the independent standing-root contract must prevent the record from becoming an eligibility gate.
? err(TA_Unwitnessed_Standing, StandingOmission).
# => FALSE
